  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DevCom 2015-2019 OECD - DevCom 2015-2019 OECD 1607</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DevCom 2015-2019 OECD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DevCom &#xe4;r ett kommunikationsn&#xe4;tverk inom OECD f&#xf6;r bist&#xe5;ndsmyndigheter och organisationer. Det &#xe4;r ett informellt forum d&#xe4;r bist&#xe5;ndsgivare    diskuterar kommunikationsfr&#xe5;gor, delar best-practice och samordnar    strategier f&#xf6;r att informera om utvecklingssamarbete. Sida deltar i   n&#xe4;tverket 2015-17.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Devcom is a communications network within OECD for development        agencies and organisations. It is an informal forum in which donors   discuss communication issues, share best practice and coordinate      strategies to inform about development cooperation. Sida will         participate in the network 2015-17.</narrative>
  </description>
